# Frontend (React/TypeScript)

## Stack

React 19, TypeScript strict, Vite, Tailwind 4, TanStack Query v5, Zustand (UI only).

## Structure

- Features: `frontend/src/features/<name>/` — colocate `api.ts`, `hooks.ts`, `types.ts`
- Shared UI: `components/ui/`, layout: `components/layout/`
- ~150 lines soft limit — extract subcomponents/hooks when growing

## State

- Server state: TanStack Query — ❌ NO server state in Zustand
- Lists: cursor pagination where API supports it

## Inputs

- `QuietInput`, `QuietSelect`, `QuietDateInput` from `@/components/ui/`
- ❌ NO `<input type="date">`, `<select>`, raw HTML inputs

## Dates & locale

- `@/lib/date`, `@/lib/locale`, `@/lib/number`
- ❌ NO `toLocaleDateString()`, bare `.toLocaleString()`, hardcoded `'en-GB'` / `'lv-LV'`

## Errors & toasts

- `mapApiError()` → `showDomainErrorToast()` — `@/shared/errors`
- Form field errors: `handleFormError()` in `@/shared/errors/handlers.ts`
- ❌ NO `window.alert()` for user-facing errors

## Touch & responsive

- Min **44px** touch targets; test at **375px**
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-2 ring-[color:var(--app-ring-strong)]` on interactive elements

**Drift patterns:** `internal-docs/starter-pack/docs/frontend/patterns/AGENT_DRIFT.md`
